{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20938","headline":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 四 · 李贺","name":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寻常轻宋玉，今日嫁文鸯。\n戟干横龙簴，刀环倚桂窗。\n邀人裁半袖，端坐据胡牀。\n泪湿红轮重，栖乌上井梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}